0.920 0.960 0.990 rg 49 492.0 497 25 re f
0.080 0.140 0.250 rg BT /F2 12.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 500.0 Tm (Theory) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 463.0 Tm (1. JSON and HTTP GET requests) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 444.0 Tm (JSON \(JavaScript Object Notation\) is a lightweight text format for exchanging structured) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 431.0 Tm (data. A client sends an HTTP GET request to a JSON resource, receives a response, and) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 418.0 Tm (parses the response body into JavaScript values before displaying it.) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 396.0 Tm (2. Loading data with fetch\(\)) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 377.0 Tm (The Fetch API returns a Promise for a network response. Calling response.json\(\) parses its) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 364.0 Tm (body asynchronously. A reliable request flow checks response.ok, handles network or parsing) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 351.0 Tm (errors, and reports a useful status to the user.) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 329.0 Tm (3. Loading data with jQuery $.getJSON\(\)) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 310.0 Tm (jQuery $.getJSON\(url\) is a shorthand for an asynchronous GET request expecting JSON. Its) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 297.0 Tm (done callback receives the parsed data, while fail can display a request error. Both APIs) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 284.0 Tm (can supply the same renderer.) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 262.0 Tm (4. Dynamic table rendering) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 243.0 Tm (JavaScript can create table rows and cells from an array of objects, then append them to a) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 230.0 Tm (table body without reloading the page. A clear empty state and safe text insertion keep the) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 217.0 Tm (output understandable and prevent data from being interpreted as markup.) Tj ET
